message: "If you use this software or its algorithm, please cite it as below."
title: "SCA Care Planner: evidence-linked care-review priorities for children with sex chromosome aneuploidies"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mitra
    given-names: Sidhartha
    affiliation: "SidLabs Online LLP"
    email: sid@sidlabs.net
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-19
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/SidLabs-Online/SCA-Care-Planner"
keywords:
  - clinical decision support
  - sex chromosome aneuploidy
  - Klinefelter syndrome
  - pediatric developmental monitoring
  - three-valued logic
  - research software
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free Python library that evaluates condition, age and
  care-history rules in three-valued logic, ranks care-review candidates with
  the workflow key P(a) = (c_a, -d_a), attaches evidence to every suggested
  action, projects rule-supported monitoring over 24 months, and turns missing
  information into ranked verification questions. It estimates no risk
  probabilities and has not been clinically validated.
